    "body": "## Summary\n\nWI3 of the Blog Accuracy & Link-Rot Resilience Program. Backfills 118 external-link snapshots across all 34 noraze.com posts and includes an audit report.\n\n## Changes\n\n- `_snapshots/` directory (new) \u2014 118 JSON snapshot files, one per (post, external-link) pair\n- `_snapshots/WI3-AUDIT-REPORT.md` (new) \u2014 full audit findings\n\n## Audit Results\n\n- **118 external links** extracted and snapshotted\n- **94 live (HTTP 200)** \u2014 79.7%\n- **15 dead (HTTP 404)** \u2014 12.7% (Microsoft Learn, Apple, VS Code, GitHub docs reorgs)\n- **5 placeholder URLs** (example.com \u2014 illustrative, not citations)\n- **4 rate-limited (HTTP 429)** \u2014 Godot docs; likely live, re-verify in 24h\n- **33/34 posts** have Sources & References section\n- **16/34 posts** have prior accuracy notes\n\n## Validation\n\n- `python3 check_blog_link_archival.py --site noraze.com` \u2192 PASS (all posts with external links have snapshot coverage)\n\n## Next Steps (follow-up sessions)\n\n1. Inject dead-link banners (WI2) for the 15 dead links\n2. Correct dead URLs with known replacements per blog-corrections.md\n3. Re-verify 4 rate-limited Godot docs links in 24h\n\n## Out of Scope\n\n- Content corrections (follow-up per blog-corrections.md)\n- Wayback submission for links without snapshots (manual)",
